{'symbol': 'NEM', 'date': '2020-01-03 20:30:00', 'title': 'Newmont Completes Sale Of Interests In KCGM, Updates 2020 Guidance And Long-Term Outlook', 'text': 'NEWMONT COMPLETES SALE OF INTERESTS IN KCGM AND UPDATES 2020 GUIDANCE AND LONG-TERM OUTLOOK.NEWMONT GOLDCORP CORP - GOLD PRODUCTION GUIDANCE IS EXPECTED TO BE 6.4 MILLION OUNCES FOR 2020 AND BETWEEN 6.2 AND 6.7 MILLION OUNCES LONGER-TERM THROUGH 2024.NEWMONT GOLDCORP CORP - GOLD CAS GUIDANCE IS UNCHANGED AT $750 PER OUNCE FOR 2020 AND BETWEEN $650 AND $750 PER OUNCE FOR 2021 AND 2022.NEWMONT GOLDCORP CORP - GOLD CAS IS EXPECTED TO BE BETWEEN $600 AND $700 PER OUNCE FOR 2023 AND 2024.NEWMONT GOLDCORP - GOLD ALL-IN SUSTAINING COSTS GUIDANCE IS UNCHANGED AT $975 PER OUNCE FOR 2020 AND BETWEEN $850 AND $950 PER OUNCE FOR 2021 AND 2022.NEWMONT GOLDCORP - ATTRIBUTABLE SUSTAINING CAPITAL GUIDANCE HAS BEEN LOWERED TO $950 MILLION FOR 2020 & BETWEEN $0.9 TO $1.1 BILLION LONGER-TERM THROUGH 2024.NEWMONT GOLDCORP CORP - GOLD ALL-IN SUSTAINING COSTS IS EXPECTED TO BE BETWEEN $800 AND $900 PER OUNCE FOR 2023 AND 2024.'}
